 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好呀。",
   "raw_sha256": "b5d4b0ad52aa6dc2962656463173db6ac3a5e6b7d42bb934a6ec4d145cce5460",
   "seconds": 1.829,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光已经悄悄爬上窗台了。",
   "raw_sha256": "39d13b119010e5d111cb3a032de05b3aa884f3cc40e0bf945814182ac773e4c8",
   "seconds": 3.011,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都放在心上。",
   "raw_sha256": "2049bd53e7d7383121f6ca5251b77e97b1b6931cae225e278bc6a204ec5963be",
   "seconds": 3.425,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先别急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "710a89ee8324db2260462040665389e6942cab7fa5361e666b3a086bb6000a30",
   "seconds": 3.611,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "告诉我，你昨晚睡得怎么样？",
   "raw_sha256": "e56a9af5ac70cb7f24316dadd574121a1b9cc508ac2ee4c97e728cff2380b51c",
   "seconds": 2.622,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，我就轻轻陪你聊一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "7031ed3a7adacb76dfda0b94c70465da9a11dddeb0663e2e0fef4ab616a880e6",
   "seconds": 3.615,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起看看今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "4844bed0188e4d7ea583b145700af9f3046295995c02ac566535b74c9d50e0ef",
   "seconds": 4.777,
   "pause_ms": 300
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "1cd00976b13b487917b37d911deb05fc985b4e4dc07591eb57f06d463ee17dbc",
   "seconds": 2.22,
   "pause_ms": 210
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢说。",
   "raw_sha256": "8c498f8f15a29e57184477ef668b29241f585f24347f505e454e7f66c427e886",
   "seconds": 2.862,
   "pause_ms": 300
  }
 ],
